docs {
  # Submit Report (Protected)

  **Method:** `POST`
  **Endpoint:** `/api/v1/reports`
  **Auth:** Required (User Access Token)

  ## Description
  Submits a moderation report against an offensive user (`reported_user_id`) or an abusive group (`reported_group_id`). At least one of them must be specified.

  ## Request

  ### Headers
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | Bearer access token (`Bearer <token>`) |
  | `Content-Type` | `string` | Yes | `application/json` |

  ### Body
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `reported_user_id` | `int64` | Conditional | User ID to report |
  | `reported_group_id` | `int64` | Conditional | Group ID to report |
  | `reason` | `string` | Yes | `SPAM`, `HARASSMENT`, `INAPPROPRIATE_CONTENT`, `FRAUD`, `PRIVACY_VIOLATION`, `OTHER` |
  | `description` | `string` | Yes | Detailed report explanation (5 - 3000 chars) |

  ## Response
  **`201 Created`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "id": 1,
      "reporter_user_id": 1,
      "reported_user_id": 2,
      "reason": "HARASSMENT",
      "description": "User is sending offensive and harassing messages repeatedly.",
      "status": "PENDING",
      "created_at": "2026-11-02T19:00:00Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-11-02T19:00:00Z"
    }
  }
  ```
}
